> At Sun, 1 Aug 2010 01:32:23 +0200,
> Manuel Lauss wrote:
> > 
> > > > >> Is there a way to insert an initial playback delay?  Under linux, the
> > > > >> first 2-2.5 seconds
> > > > >> of anything played are just silence; on windows audible playback
